{
  "id": "talan_start",
  "start": [
    {
      "node": "reconciliation_greeting",
      "when": { "flag": "told_on_talan", "equals": 1 }
    },
    {
      "node": "repeat_greeting",
      "when": { "flag": "talan_apologised", "equals": 1 }
    },
    { "node": "gate_apology" }
  ],
  "speakers": [
    {
      "id": "player",
      "name": "Banec",
      "role": "player",
      "portrait": "assets/ui/portraits/player.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "talan",
      "name": "Talan Wendth",
      "role": "npc",
      "entity": "talan",
      "portrait": "assets/ui/portraits/talan.png"
    }
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "reconciliation_greeting",
      "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "Ah, Banec, hello.",
      "choices": [{
        "text": "Hi there, Talan. Look, I am sorry that I got you into trouble with Jelom.",
        "actions": [{ "op": "set", "flag": "told_on_talan", "value": 2 }],
        "next": "talan_forgives"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_forgives",
      "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "No, I understand. It was because of me shirking my duty that I did not see what happened that night. You had no choice, and I do not hold a grudge against you for doing your duty.",
      "next": "player_thanks_talan"
    },
    {
      "id": "player_thanks_talan",
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "All the same, I am still sorry for getting you into trouble with Jelom. Thank you for understanding.",
      "end": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gate_apology",
      "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "Listen, I really am sorry about that fuss at the gate. I hope you will not hold it against me.",
      "choices": [{
        "text": "Please do not mention it again. I assure you that I hold no grudge against you.",
        "actions": [{ "op": "set", "flag": "talan_apologised", "value": 1 }],
        "next": "player_forgives"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": "player_forgives",
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "Please do not mention it again. I assure you that I hold no grudge against you.",
      "next": "talan_introduces"
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_introduces",
      "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "Thank you sir. By the way, I am Talan.",
      "next": "player_introduces"
    },
    {
      "id": "player_introduces",
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "I am Banec, and I'd like to learn a little more about the theft.",
      "next": "talan_rounds"
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_rounds",
      "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "Sure, but there is not much to tell. I was out here, making my rounds, walking around the yard like every other night.",
      "next": "talan_heard_news"
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_heard_news",
      "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "In the morning, of course, I heard that Master Fingolson's gems had been stolen and that Lady Silverhair was suspected of the theft.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "And why was Lady Silverhair accused?",
          "next": "player_asks_accusation"
        },
        {
          "text": "So you did not see or hear anything out of place that night?",
          "next": "player_asks_night"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "repeat_greeting",
      "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "Oh, hullo again, Banec.",
      "choices": [{
        "text": "Hello, Talan. Look, I have a couple more questions about the theft.",
        "next": "player_more_questions"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": "player_more_questions",
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "Hello, Talan. Look, I have a couple more questions about the theft.",
      "next": "talan_offers_help"
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_offers_help",
      "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "Oh... that. Yes, how may I help you?",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "What do you make of Master Fingolson's unusual visit?",
          "when": { "flag": "know_argument", "equals": 1 },
          "next": "talan_bjarn_visit"
        },
        {
          "text": "I hear that Alek Endhelm was very interested in Fingolson's business. Have you noticed him doing anything suspicious?",
          "when": { "flag": "know_alek_eavesdrop", "equals": 1 },
          "next": "talan_alek_busybody"
        },
        {
          "text": "I wish you had not lied to me about the night of the theft.",
          "when": { "flag": "know_talan_singing", "equals": 1 },
          "next": "talan_confronted"
        },
        {
          "text": "Why was the Lady Silverhair accused?",
          "next": "player_asks_accusation"
        },
        {
          "text": "Are you sure you haven't noticed anything out of place that night?",
          "when": { "flag": "know_talan_singing", "not_equals": 2 },
          "next": "player_asks_night_again"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_alek_busybody",
      "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "Oh, he's a nasty sort, he is, sir. But other than being a busybody, I haven't noticed him doing anything that would lead me to believe that he is the thief.",
      "next": "talan_more_questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "player_asks_night",
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "So you did not see or hear anything out of place that night?",
      "next": "talan_heard_nothing"
    },
    {
      "id": "player_asks_night_again",
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "Are you sure you haven't noticed anything out of place that night?",
      "next": "talan_heard_nothing"
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_heard_nothing",
      "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "No... no, not at all.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Couldn't it be that you missed what there was to see or hear?",
          "when": { "all": [
            { "flag": "know_talan_singing", "equals": 1 },
            { "flag": "know_olivers_noise", "equals": 0 }
          ] },
          "next": "talan_may_have_missed"
        },
        { "text": "But Lady Frostbloom told me about a noise she heard.",
          "when": { "flag": "know_noise", "equals": 2 }, "next": "talan_frostbloom_noise" },
        { "text": "I see. I have another question.", "next": "talan_more_questions" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_may_have_missed", "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "Well, I did not notice anything, Banec. That's the truth!",
      "choices": [
        { "text": "It had better be, my friend.", "next": "talan_more_questions" },
        { "text": "If I want to prove Lady Silverhair's innocence, I have little other choice, I fear.", "next": "talan_more_questions" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_frostbloom_noise", "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "Frostbloom? Then it must have been a Yeti, I suppose.",
      "next": "talan_frostbloom_serious"
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_frostbloom_serious", "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "But seriously, I did not notice anything. I'm sorry, Banec.",
      "next": "talan_more_questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_more_questions",
      "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "If you do not have any more questions ...",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "What do you make of Master Fingolson's unusual visit?",
          "when": { "flag": "know_argument", "equals": 1 },
          "next": "talan_bjarn_visit"
        },
        {
          "text": "But Lady Frostbloom told me about a noise she heard.",
          "when": { "flag": "know_noise", "equals": 2 },
          "next": "talan_frostbloom_noise"
        },
        {
          "text": "I wish you had not lied to me about the night of the theft.",
          "when": { "flag": "know_talan_singing", "equals": 1 },
          "next": "talan_confronted"
        },
        {
          "text": "And why was Lady Silverhair accused?",
          "actions": [{ "op": "set", "flag": "talan_heard_nothing", "value": 1 }],
          "next": "player_asks_accusation"
        },
        {
          "text": "No, thank you, I have a lot of work to do. You have been most helpful.",
          "actions": [{ "op": "set", "flag": "talan_heard_nothing", "value": 1 }],
          "next": "player_goodbye"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_bjarn_visit", "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "I don't know if there is any coincidence, but this visit of Master Fingolson is very unusual. You see, he is quite a regular here. He comes every other month or so, and usually stays for a week before going back.",
      "next": "talan_bjarn_visits_before"
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_bjarn_visits_before", "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "Usually he shows up a few days before the client, just to relax, I guess. Until about a year ago, he would spend this time in the common room, drinking ale and talking with Erek, his apprentice.",
      "next": "talan_bjarn_changes"
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_bjarn_changes", "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "About a year ago, things changed. When he came, he came alone. He still showed up a couple of days ahead of the client, but he no longer visited the common room much. He just stayed down in his room.",
      "next": "talan_bjarn_recent"
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_bjarn_recent", "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "But at this most recent visit, Bjarn got here the morning of Lady Silverhair's arrival, which was a little strange. What's more, he brought Erek again, although I thought he had finished his apprenticeship and moved on long ago.",
      "next": "player_thanks_for_bjarn_clue"
    },
    {
      "id": "player_thanks_for_bjarn_clue", "speaker": "player",
      "text": "I see ... that is strange. Thanks for telling me, Talan!",
      "next": "talan_more_questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_confronted", "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "Wh... what do you mean?",
      "choices": [
        { "text": "Should I rather call you a bard then?", "next": "talan_asks_about_noise" },
        { "text": "You were not, as you told me, manning your post the whole night.", "next": "talan_denies" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_asks_about_noise", "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "A ... noise? What noise?",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "The noise of someone singing, Talan.",
          "actions": [{ "op": "set", "flag": "know_talan_singing", "value": 2 }],
          "next": "talan_apologises"
        },
        {
          "text": "According to Oliver, somebody must have been in the stables that night.",
          "when": { "flag": "know_olivers_noise", "equals": 1 },
          "next": "talan_realizes_player_knows"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_realizes_player_knows", "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "Oh. So you do know ... ?",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Yes I do. And I believe you left your post that night, did you not, Talan?",
          "actions": [{ "op": "set", "flag": "know_talan_singing", "value": 2 }],
          "next": "talan_admits"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_denies", "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "Now you look here! I was, and I do not appreciate you calling me a liar.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Yes I do. And I believe you left your post that night, did you not, Talan?",
          "actions": [{ "op": "set", "flag": "know_talan_singing", "value": 2 }],
          "next": "talan_admits"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_admits", "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "Yes, I did. But please do not tell Jelom, sir! He will have my hide for sure if he finds out! Please, I beg you!",
      "next": "player_names_singing"
    },
    {
      "id": "player_names_singing", "speaker": "player",
      "text": "No, you missed it. Because you were off singing, weren't you?",
      "next": "talan_apologises"
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_apologises", "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "I'm afraid I was. Oh what terrible mistake! I am so sorry, Banec. I did not know about the noise! It is my fault that Lady Silverhair is being held in her room!",
      "next": "player_calms_talan"
    },
    {
      "id": "player_calms_talan", "speaker": "player",
      "text": "Calm down, Talan. Now I can prove that something strange happened that night at least.",
      "end": true
    },
    {
      "id": "player_asks_accusation",
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "And why was Lady Silverhair accused?",
      "next": "talan_accusation_reason"
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_accusation_reason",
      "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "Well, the most obvious reason is of course that she was interested in the gems, and made a trip here just to buy them.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "But she felt the quality of the gems was too low, and she is hardly pressed for money, so why would she turn around and steal the gems?",
          "when": { "flag": "know_low_quality", "equals": 1 },
          "next": "talan_low_quality_excuse"
        },
        {
          "text": "True, but practically anyone at the Inn could have thrown an eye on the stones.",
          "next": "player_anyone"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_low_quality_excuse", "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "Well, according to Jelom, what better way to throw suspicion off yourself then to claim that the stones are of low quality?",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Who is Jelom? Your superiour?",
          "when": { "flag": "know_jelom", "equals": 0 },
          "actions": [{ "op": "set", "flag": "know_jelom", "value": 1 }],
          "next": "player_asks_jelom"
        },
        {
          "text": "Ah, Jelom said that, did he? What else did he say?",
          "when": { "flag": "know_jelom", "equals": 1 },
          "next": "talan_suspicion"
        },
        {
          "text": "Yes. I do know what he thinks. That, however, does not help me too much.",
          "when": { "flag": "know_jelom", "equals": 2 },
          "next": "talan_more_questions"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "player_anyone",
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "True, but practically anyone at the Inn could have thrown an eye on the stones.",
      "next": "talan_jelom_certain"
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_jelom_certain",
      "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "According to Jelom there is no doubt that Lady Silverhair is the thief.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Who is Jelom? Your superiour?",
          "when": { "flag": "know_jelom", "equals": 0 },
          "actions": [{ "op": "set", "flag": "know_jelom", "value": 1 }],
          "next": "player_asks_jelom"
        },
        {
          "text": "Ah, Jelom said that, did he? What else did he say?",
          "when": { "flag": "know_jelom", "equals": 1 },
          "next": "talan_suspicion"
        },
        {
          "text": "Yes. I do know what he thinks. That, however, does not help me too much.",
          "when": { "flag": "know_jelom", "equals": 2 },
          "next": "talan_more_questions"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "player_asks_jelom",
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "Who is Jelom? Your superiour?",
      "next": "talan_explains_jelom"
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_explains_jelom",
      "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "He is the other guard here. He is not exactly my superiour, but he is older than me and has been here much longer, so he is kind of in charge.",
      "next": "talan_suspicion"
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_suspicion",
      "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "He found her behaviour suspicious. I mean, she is all high and mighty, acting above the rest of us, and she obviously doesn't like dwarves ...",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Wait! Why does everybody believe that she has an aversion to dwarves?",
          "when": { "flag": "know_bjarns_insult", "equals": 1 },
          "next": "talan_reports_bjarn_insult"
        },
        {
          "text": "Wait! Why does everybody believe that she has an aversion to dwarves?",
          "when": { "flag": "know_bjarns_insult", "not_equals": 1 },
          "next": "talan_argument"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_argument",
      "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "Well, as I heard it told, she had quite an argument with Master Fingolson in which she insulted the quality of his gems and then the dwarven race!",
      "choices": [{
        "text": "You think this argument is enough to prove Lady Silverhair's guilt?",
        "next": "player_challenges_argument"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_reports_bjarn_insult", "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "Well, the way I heard the story, Bjarn made a point of insulting the entire elven race, loudly and publicly, upon her arrival!",
      "next": "talan_softens_on_bjarn"
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_softens_on_bjarn", "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "Well, Master Fingolson can be, um ... blunt, I guess, at times, but ...",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Wasn't the argument rather Fingolson's fault, then?",
          "next": "talan_concedes_bjarn_fault"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_concedes_bjarn_fault", "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "Well, I... ah, perhaps...",
      "next": "talan_suggests_jelom"
    },
    {
      "id": "player_challenges_argument",
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "You think this argument is enough to prove Lady Silverhair's guilt?",
      "next": "talan_unsure"
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_unsure",
      "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "I ... I don't know.",
      "next": "talan_suggests_jelom"
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_suggests_jelom",
      "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "Maybe you should speak to Jelom. He knows more about the theft and his reasons for suspecting her than I do...",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "And so I shall. Where is he?",
          "next": "player_asks_location"
        },
        {
          "text": "Well, I shall go and talk to him, then. Thank you and good day.",
          "next": "player_goodbye_jelom"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "player_asks_location",
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "And so I shall. Where is he?",
      "next": "talan_jelom_location"
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_jelom_location",
      "speaker": "talan",
      "text": "He is guarding the hallway leading to Lady Silverhair's room.",
      "next": "player_goodbye_jelom"
    },
    {
      "id": "player_goodbye_jelom",
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "Well, I shall go and talk to him, then. Thank you and good day.",
      "end": true
    },
    {
      "id": "player_goodbye",
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "No, thank you, I have a lot of work to do. You have been most helpful.",
      "end": true
    }
  ]
}
